{"title":"Python爬虫：urllib中Handler与Opener的基本使用","slug":"2024-07-26-urllib_handler的基本使用","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.106Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-urllib_handler的基本使用.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在 Python 爬虫开发中，<code>urllib</code> 是内置的标准库。虽然我们经常使用 <code>urllib.request.urlopen()</code> 来发送请求，但在处理更复杂的场景（如 Cookie 处理、代理设置、HTTPS 认证）时，仅仅使用 <code>urlopen</code> 往往不够灵活。</p>\n<p>这就需要引入更底层的处理器对象和自定义打开器。本文将以访问百度首页为例，详细讲解 <code>Handler</code> 和 <code>Opener</code> 的基本使用方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\"><a href=\"#核心概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心概念\"></a>核心概念</h2><p>在代码实操之前，我们需要理解两个核心概念：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Handlers（处理器）</strong>：<code>Handler</code> 是 <code>urllib</code> 中处理特定协议（如 HTTP、HTTPS、FTP）或功能（如代理、Cookie、重定向）的对象。通过不同的 Handler，我们可以定制 URL 打开的行为。</li>\n<li><strong>Opener（打开器）</strong>：<code>Opener</code> 是通过 <code>build_opener()</code> 方法将多个 Handler 组装在一起形成的对象。它相当于一个自定义的浏览器客户端，拥有 <code>open()</code> 方法来发送请求。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"代码实操\"><a href=\"#代码实操\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实操\"></a>代码实操</h2><p>下面的代码演示了如何构建一个带有浏览器标识的请求头，通过 <code>HTTPHandler</code> 和自定义 <code>Opener</code> 来获取百度首页的源码。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 导入 urllib.request 模块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 定义目标 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://www.baidu.com&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 构建请求头，模拟浏览器访问</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.36&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 创建 Request 对象，封装 URL 和 Headers</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">request = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># --- Handler 与 Opener 核心步骤 ---</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 获取 HTTPHandler 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># HTTPHandler 专门用于处理 HTTP 请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">handler = urllib.request.HTTPHandler()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. 获取 Opener 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 build_opener 将 handler 传入，构建自定义的 opener</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">opener = urllib.request.build_opener(handler)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. 调用 open 方法发送请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用自定义 opener 发送请求，获取响应对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = opener.<span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(request)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 7. 读取并解码响应内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打印结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 步骤详解</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **构建请求头**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    百度等搜索引擎通常会检测请求头中的 `User-Agent`。如果不设置，Python 默认的 UA 为 `Python-urllib/x.x`，极易被反爬机制拦截。因此，我们需要构造字典模拟 Chrome 浏览器访问。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **创建 Request 对象**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `urllib.request.Request` 类允许我们将 URL、Headers、Data 等参数封装成一个独立的请求对象，便于管理。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **实例化 Handler**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `handler = urllib.request.HTTPHandler()` 创建了一个处理 HTTP 协议的处理器。这也是 `urlopen` 默认使用的处理器，显式写出是为了方便后续扩展（例如替换为支持代理的 `ProxyHandler`）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  **构建 Opener**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `opener = urllib.request.build_opener(handler)` 将处理器组装成打开器。这就好比我们将引擎装到了汽车上。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span>  **发送请求**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `opener.<span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(request)` 最终执行请求，返回结果与 `urlopen` 一致，是一个类文件对象，可以使用 `read()` 方法读取数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">虽然本例中使用 `HTTPHandler` 看起来比直接使用 `urlopen` 代码量更多，但这套流程是进阶爬虫的基础。当你需要使用 IP 代理池或自动管理 Cookie 时，只需将 `HTTPHandler` 替换为 `ProxyHandler` 或 `HTTPCookieProcessor`，并同样构建 `Opener` 即可，具有很强的扩展性。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在 Python 爬虫开发中，<code>urllib</code> 是内置的标准库。虽然我们经常使用 <code>urllib.request.urlopen()</code> 来发送请求，但在处理更复杂的场景（如 Cookie 处理、代理设置、HTTPS 认证）时，仅仅使用 <code>urlopen</code> 往往不够灵活。</p>\n<p>这就需要引入更底层的处理器对象和自定义打开器。本文将以访问百度首页为例，详细讲解 <code>Handler</code> 和 <code>Opener</code> 的基本使用方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\"><a href=\"#核心概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心概念\"></a>核心概念</h2><p>在代码实操之前，我们需要理解两个核心概念：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Handlers（处理器）</strong>：<code>Handler</code> 是 <code>urllib</code> 中处理特定协议（如 HTTP、HTTPS、FTP）或功能（如代理、Cookie、重定向）的对象。通过不同的 Handler，我们可以定制 URL 打开的行为。</li>\n<li><strong>Opener（打开器）</strong>：<code>Opener</code> 是通过 <code>build_opener()</code> 方法将多个 Handler 组装在一起形成的对象。它相当于一个自定义的浏览器客户端，拥有 <code>open()</code> 方法来发送请求。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"代码实操\"><a href=\"#代码实操\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实操\"></a>代码实操</h2><p>下面的代码演示了如何构建一个带有浏览器标识的请求头，通过 <code>HTTPHandler</code> 和自定义 <code>Opener</code> 来获取百度首页的源码。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 导入 urllib.request 模块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 定义目标 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://www.baidu.com&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 构建请求头，模拟浏览器访问</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.36&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 创建 Request 对象，封装 URL 和 Headers</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">request = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># --- Handler 与 Opener 核心步骤 ---</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 获取 HTTPHandler 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># HTTPHandler 专门用于处理 HTTP 请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">handler = urllib.request.HTTPHandler()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. 获取 Opener 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 build_opener 将 handler 传入，构建自定义的 opener</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">opener = urllib.request.build_opener(handler)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. 调用 open 方法发送请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用自定义 opener 发送请求，获取响应对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = opener.<span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(request)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 7. 读取并解码响应内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打印结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 步骤详解</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **构建请求头**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    百度等搜索引擎通常会检测请求头中的 `User-Agent`。如果不设置，Python 默认的 UA 为 `Python-urllib/x.x`，极易被反爬机制拦截。因此，我们需要构造字典模拟 Chrome 浏览器访问。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **创建 Request 对象**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `urllib.request.Request` 类允许我们将 URL、Headers、Data 等参数封装成一个独立的请求对象，便于管理。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **实例化 Handler**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `handler = urllib.request.HTTPHandler()` 创建了一个处理 HTTP 协议的处理器。这也是 `urlopen` 默认使用的处理器，显式写出是为了方便后续扩展（例如替换为支持代理的 `ProxyHandler`）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  **构建 Opener**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `opener = urllib.request.build_opener(handler)` 将处理器组装成打开器。这就好比我们将引擎装到了汽车上。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span>  **发送请求**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    `opener.<span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(request)` 最终执行请求，返回结果与 `urlopen` 一致，是一个类文件对象，可以使用 `read()` 方法读取数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">虽然本例中使用 `HTTPHandler` 看起来比直接使用 `urlopen` 代码量更多，但这套流程是进阶爬虫的基础。当你需要使用 IP 代理池或自动管理 Cookie 时，只需将 `HTTPHandler` 替换为 `ProxyHandler` 或 `HTTPCookieProcessor`，并同样构建 `Opener` 即可，具有很强的扩展性。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Python爬虫","path":"api/categories/Python爬虫.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"urllib","path":"api/tags/urllib.json"}]}